{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24584","headline":"自题小园 · 白居易","name":"自题小园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不鬬门馆华，不鬬林园大。\n但鬬爲主人，一坐十余载。\n回看甲乙第，列在都城内。\n素垣夹朱门，蔼蔼遥相对。\n主人安在哉，富贵去不回。\n池乃爲鱼凿，林乃爲禽栽。\n何如小园主，拄杖闲即来。\n亲宾有时会，琴酒连夜开。\n以此聊自足，不羡大池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}